## SQ-CDS-01 | sample syringe
@group A
@commands `grep -E "sample_syringe\|Error" logs/kubejs/startup.log \| head`; `/give @p creativeengineering:cow_sample_syringe`; right-click a cow with `creativeengineering:sample_syringe`
@pass Syringe items exist; sampling fills it
@fails `global.sampleSyringe` not set before the item callback
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
shell grep -E "sample_syringe|Error" logs/kubejs/startup.log | head -5 | cut -c1-200
> give qa creativeengineering:cow_sample_syringe
> give qa creativeengineering:sample_syringe
reject Unknown item
look both syringes exist (sampling a cow is a client / bot-use check)

## SQ-CDS-02 | CD kitchen tags (dumptags of SQ-CBM-05)
@group A
@commands Same boot: `/dumptags` block `creativeengineering:oven_heat_sources`, `farmersdelight:heat_sources` (has the oven), `minecraft:mineable/shovel` (the six dough blocks), `creativeengineering:crops/farmland_soils`; item `creativeengineering:hoe_harvest/5x5`, `forge:storage_blocks/sourdough`
@pass Same contents as before the move
@fails CD tag script not loaded
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/tag_diff.py $INST/perf/runs/rcs234/boot2_tags kubejs/exported/tags block:creativeengineering:oven_heat_sources block:farmersdelight:heat_sources block:minecraft:mineable/shovel block:creativeengineering:crops/farmland_soils item:creativeengineering:hoe_harvest/5x5 item:forge:storage_blocks/sourdough
look same contents as boot 2 (heat_sources has the oven only after wave 4 if the oven moved: judge the diff)

